<title>CHINA: SWIRE PACIFIC INTERIM NET UP 8.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>SWIRE PACIFIC INTERIM NET UP 8.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>Earnings per A Shr (H.K. cents) 209.7 vs 192.7</p>
<p>Earnings per B Shr (H.K. cents) 41.9 vs 38.5</p>
<p>    Dividend A shr (H.K. cents)     47.0 vs 43.0</p>
<p>    Dividend B shr (H.K. cents)     9.4 vs 8.6</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		   nil vs 468.0 gain</p>
<p>    Net				     3,315.0 vs 3,055.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				13,283.0 vs 23,478.0</p>
<p>    Company name			  Swire Pacific Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close			   September 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		    October 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Swire Pacific is a general trading house with interests in aviaton, property, shipping and offshore services industries, trading and insurance.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
